products that you want to develop.

00:53:06.170 --> 00:53:08.300
And I'm curious what the
balance is of things like that

00:53:08.300 --> 00:53:10.660
where you get to be
entrepreneurial versus--

00:53:11.420 --> 00:53:14.210
and that goes into some kind
of portfolio of prioritization

00:53:14.210 --> 00:53:18.140
