I used the Shiny app to get
it done. So early on I was--

00:56:57.280 --> 00:57:00.430
this was before when I
was doing the model validation

00:57:00.430 --> 00:57:02.990
stuff. So I kind of had--

00:57:02.990 --> 00:57:05.060
